The +load signature: The IDF/Mossad architecture deploys through <code>+load</code> — the method that runs before any other code, before <code>main()</code>, before any oversight object is initialized:

```objc
@implementation CovertOperation
+ (void)load {
  // executes before any oversight layer initializes
  [self.caesarea plantDevice:targetLocation
                      months:6
           priorToActivation:YES];
}
- (void)execute:(Target *)t {
  [self.kidon detonate:self.prePlantedDevice]; // just the last step
}
@end
```

The signature Mossad operation — pre-positioning an asset months or years before it activates — is the intelligence equivalent of <code>+load</code>. By the time anyone knows an operation is happening, the implementation was installed long ago. The Haniyeh device is the textbook case.
